STATE

  Version 0.2.2 on branch dev (Phase P3; Fred accepted 0.2.2 on
  2026-11-23, W15). Implemented and verified:
  - Incremental scrollback search (include/tam-last/search.h,
    src/search.c, Ctrl+Shift+R): smart-case UTF-8 and wide-character
    matching across scrollback and live screen, match highlighting,
    wrap-around Ctrl+R/Ctrl+S/Up/Down navigation, Enter to select to
    primary, Esc to restore view_offset.
  - Keyboard URL mode (include/tam-last/url.h, src/url.c, Ctrl+Shift+O):
    detects visible OSC 8 hyperlinks and plain-text URLs with balanced
    punctuation trimming and scheme allowlisting, overlays prefix-free
    home-row hint labels, opens via xdg-open (Shift+key copies instead),
    plus Ctrl+Left-Click on hovered OSC 8 links.
  - Desktop notifications (OSC 777 and OSC 99 in src/osc.c,
    include/tam-last/action.h, src/action.c): dispatched via notify-send
    (integrating with Quickshell's freedesktop notification service) with
    a 4-process concurrency cap and 3000 ms monotonic deadline; poll()
    stays timeout-free when idle. Policy notify=unfocused|yes|no in
    tam-last.ini (default unfocused) and --notify on the CLI.
  - Interactive sandbox/demo-daily (option c in sandbox/play).

